{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The original is intentionally spare: a black shirt whose printed Unix timestamp keeps advancing until checkout. I’m preserving that core conceit, but upgrading it into a responsive, print-aware “moment capture” experience with an immutable time capsule per order."}}
